    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "The idea",
      "body": [
        "Small models are bad at inventing a good design and good at filling in a form. So the design is **already built**, and the model only fills in the form.",
        "The form is checked by a script that explains every mistake in plain words."
      ],
      "bullets": [
        "Real numbers come from the scanner.",
        "Every box has a short label and a longer note.",
        "Nothing is decorated with emoji."
      ],
      "quote": "Design once, fill in forever."
    },
